Whipped coffee: @instant coffee{2%tbsp}, @sugar{1.5%tbsp}, and @hot water{2%tbsp}. Froth until thick foamy consistency is achieved.

Method: combine @gin{1%oz}, @campari{1%oz} (or aperitivo cappelletti) and @sweet vermouth{1%oz} in a mixing glass or directly in the rocks glass with ice and stir until well chilled. Gently pour the whipped coffee over top.